1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,976
Welcome to the Brightwell CCM technical training.

2
00:00:05,076 --> 00:00:10,242
In this video, you'll learn how to create a new patient profile in ThoroughCare.

3
00:00:11,892 --> 00:00:18,676
On the Brightwell account, we provide Chronic Care Management to patients who live in skilled nursing facilities.

4
00:00:18,926 --> 00:00:23,966
Every patient task you receive is one of two types: follow-up, or scratch.

5
00:00:24,116 --> 00:00:29,068
A follow-up patient has been enrolled in the CCM program for a few months,

6
00:00:29,108 --> 00:00:36,168
so their profile already exists in ThoroughCare, as well as in PointClickCare and Practice Fusion.

7
00:00:36,418 --> 00:00:39,097
A scratch patient was enrolled this month.

8
00:00:39,137 --> 00:00:45,196
Their records are in PointClickCare and Practice Fusion, but there's no ThoroughCare profile yet.

9
00:00:45,236 --> 00:00:47,887
So you'll create one, from scratch.

10
00:00:49,637 --> 00:00:52,635
A scratch task gives you everything you need:

11
00:00:52,675 --> 00:00:57,919
the patient's name, date of birth, facility, provider, and ICD-10 code.

12
00:00:58,069 --> 00:01:01,964
Keep it open. You'll copy each value into ThoroughCare.

13
00:01:03,414 --> 00:01:05,673
Start on the ThoroughCare dashboard.

14
00:01:05,713 --> 00:01:08,568
In the top-right corner, click New Patient.

15
00:01:09,714 --> 00:01:11,960
The Create Patient form opens.

16
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,878
Enter the patient's first and last name, exactly as they appear in the task.

17
00:01:17,528 --> 00:01:19,731
Next, enter the date of birth.

18
00:01:20,731 --> 00:01:24,115
Then select whether the patient is male or female.

19
00:01:24,765 --> 00:01:28,500
For Department, choose the facility where the patient lives.

20
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:32,837
Type the facility name from your task, then select it from the list.

21
00:01:33,587 --> 00:01:37,900
Under Eligible For Programs, make sure CCM is checked.

22
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:42,735
For Primary Provider, select the provider listed in the task.

23
00:01:43,485 --> 00:01:46,652
For Primary Care Manager, select your own name.

24
00:01:46,692 --> 00:01:50,953
Every care manager with a ThoroughCare account appears in this list.

25
00:01:51,703 --> 00:01:56,327
Before you save, scroll back up and check each entry against the task.

26
00:01:56,977 --> 00:02:02,124
Then scroll to the bottom of the form, and click Create Patient to save the profile.

27
00:02:04,074 --> 00:02:05,429
Let's recap.

28
00:02:05,469 --> 00:02:12,263
For a scratch patient, click New Patient, then complete the first and last name, date of birth, sex,

29
00:02:12,303 --> 00:02:17,673
department, the CCM program, primary provider, and primary care manager.

30
00:02:17,723 --> 00:02:21,344
Finally, review your entries and click Create Patient.

31
00:02:23,194 --> 00:02:27,441
And that's it. You've created a new patient profile in ThoroughCare.
